 trips\n- “Check in” at cabins and destinations with SjekkUT\n- Track your trips and save your own favorite places\n- Download offline maps that you can use when you’re outdoors without mobile coverage\n\t\nRemember that all activities in nature is at your own risk, and the app is only intended as a extra tool for planning and navigation. Your phone may run out of battery or stop working. Therefore, bring a map and compass when going on a trip in the outdoors - they always work. Also see the Norwegian Mountain Code at https://www.dnt.no/en/mountaincode. These tips helps you plan and complete a safe, enjoyable trip – which is also safe.","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":3.73913,"sellerUrl":"https://ut.no/","languageCodesISO2A":["EN"],"fileSizeBytes":"83853312","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":23,"trackContentRating":"4+","bundleId":"no.nrk.mobil.UT","minimumOsVersion":"15.1","userRatingCount":23}